# autotune-notcw: Auto Tune v2 (issue #190) REFUSING to run outside CW/CWR.
#
# The radio is in USB and the same APP 6 "Auto Tune" button is pressed through the
# user's path (button_action_cb -> main_screen_action(ACTION_ATUNE) ->
# autotune_ui_toggle()). Auto Tune is CW/CWR only: the action must reject with
# "Auto Tune: CW/CWR only" (the exact text is pinned on the source by
# tests/check_autotune_v2.py, because the harness' event_send() is a no-op and the
# message bar is not drawn), open NO session and leave the dial untouched.
#
# scenario_settle codifies exactly that: the session never started, the dial is
# still the fixture frequency and no CW sample was ever requested. Without those
# checks the bank would capture a quiet dial and report green for a function that
# silently retunes in SSB.

name autotune-notcw
screen autotune-notcw

seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
